Organism: SpeciesCard
Status: canonical
Role: item-detail-overlay
Interaction policy: action-required
Exports: lib/features/pack/presentation/widgets/species_card.dart
Public API: lib/features/pack/presentation/widgets/species_card.dart

Purpose:
  Presents one exact recognized Pack Item. Examined unidentified Items reveal shared Base Item identity and content but no Variable Property Values, and hand off only to the distinct Identification Service; unexamined input remains a semantic silhouette with no direct identify or reveal action.
